# Project Overview

Personal MERN blog system with article publishing, comment moderation, tag filtering, and light/dark/neon theme modes. Frontend and backend are deployed together, with frontend static assets served by Express.

## Tech Stack

**Frontend:** React 19, Vite 6, React Router 7, TipTap editor, Axios, date-fns, Tailwind CSS, reCAPTCHA

**Backend:** Node.js (ESM), Express 5, Mongoose, JWT (cookie-based auth), cookie-parser, CORS, csurf, express-rate-limit, sanitize-html, multer + Cloudinary

**Database:** MongoDB (posts, comments; timestamps and moderation workflow)

Assume intermediate JavaScript/React knowledge; explain advanced backend security and architecture decisions when used.
